<title>UK: Holderbank unit sets 200 mln Sfr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Holderbank unit sets 200 mln Sfr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOLDERBANK CAPITAL CORP LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  HOLDERBANK FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    07.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.0     PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
